.TH "logger:tail" 1 "November 2026" "SPP Framework" "SPP Commands Manual"
.SH NAME
logger:tail \- Tail the SPP application log file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B php spp.php logger:tail
[\-\-lines=\fINUM\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Tail the SPP application log file. Provides a static snapshot of the trailing lines from the primary application log.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-\-lines =\fINUM\fR
Number of trailing lines to display (default: 20, minimum: 1, maximum: 500). Can also be supplied as the first positional argument.
.SH UNDER THE HOOD
Inspects \fISPP_LOG_DIR/spp.log\fR and prints the requested slice to standard output.
